WEBVTT

00:07.625 --> 00:09.025
SAY NO TO PIRACY, SUPPORT ORIGINALS

01:35.625 --> 01:38.865
ADAPTED FROM THE ORIGINAL WEB NOVEL
<i>THE EARLY SPRING</i>, BY GU NIANG BIE KU

02:00.065 --> 02:02.025
What would you have said?

02:02.105 --> 02:05.065
And back then, I was craving
my dad's braised fish.

02:15.105 --> 02:16.185
Do not halt the project.

02:16.265 --> 02:17.225
Make sure everything is in order.

02:17.305 --> 02:18.545
I'll rush back now.

02:19.865 --> 02:20.745
Dad.

02:21.265 --> 02:22.465
I feel cold.

02:23.705 --> 02:24.985
I have work to do.

02:25.065 --> 02:26.185
Your mom will be here later.

02:26.265 --> 02:27.545
Call the nurse if you need anything.

03:14.065 --> 03:18.305
FOLLOW ME HOME

03:31.385 --> 03:32.985
You didn't have to come to work this soon.

03:33.825 --> 03:35.385
Running around won't do
your recovery any good.

03:40.865 --> 03:43.625
Your arm hasn't healed yet,
and you are driving.

03:45.545 --> 03:48.345
I use my hands to steer, not my arms.

03:52.025 --> 03:53.265
Shang Zhitao.

03:54.665 --> 03:57.225
At work, courtesy is redundant.

03:57.305 --> 03:59.225
It's all about an air of gravitas.

03:59.825 --> 04:02.145
If your opponent knows you're a pushover,

04:02.225 --> 04:04.465
you'll be swallowed whole.

04:05.785 --> 04:07.585
Noted. Thank you.

04:07.665 --> 04:10.025
Didn't I tell you to stop
thanking someone easily?

04:10.105 --> 04:11.065
Have you forgotten?

04:12.465 --> 04:13.905
I'll bear that in mind, Luke.

04:21.585 --> 04:23.745
Are you not going to ask
where we are going?

04:23.825 --> 04:25.385
Aren't you afraid I'll sell you out?

04:27.545 --> 04:29.185
I owe my life to you.

04:29.265 --> 04:32.185
Whatever it is, it's my treat.

04:34.745 --> 04:36.225
I owe my life to you too.

04:36.865 --> 04:38.185
How do you want me to repay it?

04:43.585 --> 04:45.625
I hate owing someone a favor.

04:46.425 --> 04:47.705
Let's just pretend
it's just you who owes me a favor.

04:51.985 --> 04:55.545
Then, how do you want me to repay you?

04:59.625 --> 05:00.585
Slowly.

05:51.665 --> 05:54.625
This… This is a restaurant?

05:54.705 --> 05:56.465
Are you afraid I'll dump your body
in the wilderness?

05:59.945 --> 06:04.545
BE BACK SOON

06:04.625 --> 06:05.585
Mian is waiting for you.

06:08.785 --> 06:09.825
Let's go in.

06:20.585 --> 06:21.425
Okay.

06:25.185 --> 06:28.505
BE BACK SOON

06:32.705 --> 06:33.545
Over here.

06:40.905 --> 06:41.785
Careful.

08:22.265 --> 08:23.185
Thanks.

08:25.025 --> 08:26.105
Didn't you say
you were craving braised fish?

08:29.305 --> 08:31.585
Which one do you want? Catch it yourself.

09:41.305 --> 09:44.825
You must be the smart student
who doesn't need to study hard

09:44.905 --> 09:46.905
to get first place in your examinations.

09:47.545 --> 09:49.505
Do you truly think
smart students never study?

09:51.345 --> 09:53.345
I used to think hard work would pay off,

09:53.425 --> 09:56.625
but I don't think so anymore.

09:57.465 --> 09:58.905
How's the catch?

09:59.905 --> 10:01.265
Did you get any fish?

10:05.505 --> 10:06.345
Tan Mian.

10:07.905 --> 10:09.225
Owner of this private restaurant.

10:09.305 --> 10:11.105
Also an advertisement veteran
who knows how to cook the best.

10:11.825 --> 10:12.665
Thank you.

10:14.625 --> 10:15.665
Shang Zhitao.

10:16.505 --> 10:18.105
-Hi, Ms. Shang.
-Hi.

10:22.665 --> 10:24.745
All right. Stop fishing. It's tedious.

10:24.825 --> 10:26.665
Ms. Shang. Which one do you want?

10:26.745 --> 10:28.265
I brought a net to scoop it up for you.

10:28.985 --> 10:32.065
Teaching one to fish
is better than giving them a fish.

10:34.265 --> 10:36.025
Yes. I want to catch one myself.

10:50.305 --> 10:52.785
Luke, thanks for teaching me how to fish.

10:52.865 --> 10:55.025
I now understand that
not only do I have to work hard,

10:55.105 --> 10:56.625
but I have to seize the right timing too.

10:56.705 --> 10:58.105
I didn't teach you anything.

10:58.185 --> 10:59.385
You learned it yourself.

11:02.545 --> 11:03.825
The food is ready.

11:06.505 --> 11:07.425
Try it.

11:07.505 --> 11:10.665
My secret grilled fish.

11:18.225 --> 11:19.465
Thank you.

11:25.825 --> 11:26.905
Girlfriend?

11:27.825 --> 11:28.825
No.

11:29.505 --> 11:31.825
Luke and I are colleagues.

11:33.865 --> 11:35.705
Does she look like my girlfriend at all?

11:36.305 --> 11:37.505
Right.

11:40.625 --> 11:43.625
Then, this colleague of yours
must be more important than a girlfriend.

11:44.785 --> 11:47.065
You are serving her personally.

11:48.785 --> 11:50.385
Focus when you're eating fish.

11:50.465 --> 11:51.385
Enjoy it.

11:57.865 --> 11:59.505
-It's nice.
-Right?

12:00.705 --> 12:02.425
The fish you caught
will always taste good.

12:03.545 --> 12:05.145
If you know how to use bait,

12:06.425 --> 12:07.785
you won't find yourself lacking in fish.

12:11.225 --> 12:13.665
Yes. We should always learn from Luke

12:13.745 --> 12:15.225
so that we don't become idiots.

12:18.185 --> 12:19.345
You hold grudges.

12:23.385 --> 12:24.345
Ms. Shang.

12:24.425 --> 12:25.545
I have a question.

12:25.625 --> 12:29.345
What do you think
is Luke's biggest talent?

12:31.745 --> 12:32.865
His creativity.

12:32.945 --> 12:34.905
Everyone says Luke

12:34.985 --> 12:37.225
is a prodigy in the advertising industry
that you can't find elsewhere.

12:39.025 --> 12:39.985
Prodigy?

12:41.185 --> 12:42.865
Ten years ago, I thought so too.

12:42.945 --> 12:46.345
I thought one good slogan
could leverage the entire Pacific Ocean.

12:46.425 --> 12:48.185
But you can generate
as much hype as you want.

12:48.265 --> 12:49.945
If your client's products
are not sold out,

12:50.025 --> 12:53.305
they won't give you the budget
to support your vision.

12:57.185 --> 12:58.465
See, Ms. Shang?

12:58.545 --> 13:01.185
His biggest talent is not creativity,

13:01.785 --> 13:03.145
but nitpicking.

13:04.265 --> 13:06.105
When he nitpicks,

13:07.185 --> 13:09.145
his words are more precise than a slogan.

13:12.305 --> 13:13.505
Dig in.

13:17.225 --> 13:18.705
It's probably a circuit breaker trip.

13:18.785 --> 13:20.265
Just eat. Let me check on it.

13:33.385 --> 13:34.705
How did you come in?

13:34.785 --> 13:35.705
You pried the lock open?

13:36.465 --> 13:37.705
Mr. Tan.

13:39.065 --> 13:39.945
Where is Luan Nian?

13:41.225 --> 13:42.065
Luan Nian?

13:42.145 --> 13:43.185
I told you he and I are no longer friends.

13:43.265 --> 13:45.105
We have closed. Just leave.

13:46.585 --> 13:48.305
How many drinks did you have?

13:48.385 --> 13:50.745
-I'll hail a taxi to get you home.
-I heard someone talking inside.

13:50.825 --> 13:51.785
-Hey you…
-You're lying to me!

13:51.865 --> 13:52.665
Why would I lie to you?

13:52.745 --> 13:54.225
Luan Nian is inside. I know it.

13:54.305 --> 13:55.385
-Luan Nian!
-No, he isn't.

13:55.465 --> 13:57.385
-It's my other friend.
-Listen. You're there, aren't you?

13:57.465 --> 13:58.785
Luan Nian isn't here.

13:58.865 --> 14:00.665
If you lie to me,
I'll burn your restaurant.

14:00.745 --> 14:02.225
Burn my restaurant?

14:02.305 --> 14:03.825
That's a crime, miss.

14:03.905 --> 14:05.825
Do you know
how much jail time you will get?

14:06.425 --> 14:07.625
Stop taking me for a fool.

14:07.705 --> 14:10.305
-Luan Nian! I know you're in there.
-He isn't here.

14:10.385 --> 14:12.585
-Don't ignore me. Come out.
-Just leave.

14:12.665 --> 14:14.625
-Luan Nian! Luan Nian!
-Go.

14:14.705 --> 14:15.785
-Careful.
-He isn't here.

14:15.865 --> 14:16.745
Just go.

14:16.825 --> 14:17.865
-Luan Nian!
-Careful.

14:17.945 --> 14:19.025
-Don't worry.
-Don't ignore me.

14:19.105 --> 14:20.025
Come out now!

14:20.105 --> 14:22.225
Just let me see you. We need to talk.

14:22.305 --> 14:24.305
Luan Nian!

14:24.385 --> 14:26.385
-I won't leave unless you come out.
-What happened?

14:26.465 --> 14:28.665
-Luan Nian!
-Something came up.

14:28.745 --> 14:29.945
Let's call it a day now.

14:30.025 --> 14:31.705
-Luan Nian.
-After she leaves,

14:31.785 --> 14:32.905
I'll drive you back.

14:33.425 --> 14:34.265
Okay.

14:43.545 --> 14:44.465
Luan Nian.

14:51.705 --> 14:53.185
I finally get to see you.

14:58.505 --> 14:59.585
Luan Nian.

15:00.185 --> 15:01.825
I'm begging you.

15:01.905 --> 15:03.505
Let's get back together.

15:04.465 --> 15:05.585
I won't be what I was before.

15:05.665 --> 15:06.945
I'll change.

15:09.145 --> 15:09.985
Zhang Xin.

15:11.305 --> 15:12.265
We already broke up.

15:13.425 --> 15:15.145
You need to accept the truth.

15:15.745 --> 15:17.705
There's no point in holding
onto this any longer.

15:20.345 --> 15:21.425
No point?

15:23.745 --> 15:26.345
For you, I argued with my parents,

15:27.665 --> 15:29.905
gave up everything I had in the US,
and returned to Beijing.

15:31.065 --> 15:33.705
-Is that nothing in your eyes?
-You made the decision yourself.

15:34.305 --> 15:35.905
Don't pin that on me.

15:36.745 --> 15:39.305
We both chose to break up.

15:39.385 --> 15:40.745
It's been a year.

15:41.665 --> 15:42.985
You've been texting, calling,
and stalking me.

15:43.065 --> 15:44.425
Enough is enough.

15:44.505 --> 15:45.585
It's time to put an end to this.

15:46.625 --> 15:48.785
I am having a private moment
with my friend.

15:48.865 --> 15:50.145
Please leave.

15:54.025 --> 15:55.425
Your friend?

15:55.505 --> 15:57.345
Don't deny it.

15:57.425 --> 15:58.505
She's your new love interest.

16:06.945 --> 16:08.945
Relationships go through ups and downs.

16:09.025 --> 16:10.305
We broke up.

16:11.145 --> 16:13.105
So, I'll just wait
until you break up with her.

16:15.385 --> 16:17.065
When did you two get together?

16:21.025 --> 16:22.105
You misunderstood.

16:22.665 --> 16:24.025
We're just co-workers.

16:24.705 --> 16:26.185
This is between us.

16:26.785 --> 16:28.065
Do not involve other people.

16:32.465 --> 16:33.425
Go inside first.

16:35.145 --> 16:36.145
-Don't come near me!
-Zhang Xin.

16:36.225 --> 16:37.425
-Don't come near me.
-Drop it.

16:37.505 --> 16:38.745
Calm down.

16:40.105 --> 16:41.545
Don't do anything reckless.

16:41.625 --> 16:43.225
Put the knife down now.

16:43.305 --> 16:44.505
Leave this place.

16:44.585 --> 16:45.825
I'll pretend nothing happened here.

16:45.905 --> 16:47.625
I already called the police.

16:59.465 --> 17:00.985
I love you so much.

17:03.705 --> 17:05.865
Yet you go and love someone else.

17:10.865 --> 17:12.865
Calm down. Put the knife down.

17:16.385 --> 17:18.944
You know what? Let's talk. Okay?

17:19.985 --> 17:21.265
Tell me.

17:22.424 --> 17:23.464
What did I do wrong?

17:26.345 --> 17:27.745
I think you need treatment.

17:28.265 --> 17:29.785
I'll go with you to see a therapist.

17:29.865 --> 17:30.905
No.

17:31.625 --> 17:33.505
You used to call me a control freak.

17:34.545 --> 17:36.185
You think I'm sick, don't you?

17:36.265 --> 17:38.305
-You think I'm crazy?
-No, I do not.

17:39.385 --> 17:40.905
But you cannot
let this obsession continue.

17:41.425 --> 17:42.185
Give me the knife.

17:43.985 --> 17:45.465
-Are you okay, Luan Nian?
-Are you out of your mind?

17:46.185 --> 17:47.025
‎Luan Nian…

17:48.985 --> 17:49.825
I'm fine.

17:50.825 --> 17:52.065
-I…
-Again?

17:52.145 --> 17:53.505
Are you okay?

18:00.745 --> 18:03.145
Stop her.

18:23.265 --> 18:24.185
Ms. Shang.

18:24.865 --> 18:26.865
-You must have been terrified.
-No.

18:28.265 --> 18:30.025
Please don't misunderstand.

18:30.665 --> 18:32.945
They only dated briefly,

18:33.025 --> 18:34.465
and they broke up a long time ago.

18:34.545 --> 18:36.065
I can reassure you

18:36.145 --> 18:38.825
that Luke would never two-time anyone.

18:38.905 --> 18:40.185
No, you have the wrong idea.

18:40.265 --> 18:41.945
We really are just colleagues.

18:42.025 --> 18:43.345
He's my superior.

18:43.425 --> 18:48.145
Then, you're the first co-worker
he brought to my restaurant.

18:52.625 --> 18:54.505
That's because he has helped me a lot.

18:54.585 --> 18:57.225
I wanted to buy him a meal to thank him.

18:59.105 --> 19:02.465
Perhaps you didn't know
that Luke and I were co-workers once too.

19:03.665 --> 19:06.345
In one year, I closed deals
worth 80 million yuan.

19:06.425 --> 19:07.945
Yet he never bought me dinner.

19:08.545 --> 19:11.505
Did you use to work in Lime too?

19:11.585 --> 19:12.505
No.

19:12.585 --> 19:14.505
Luke and I worked together
before he went to Lime.

19:15.385 --> 19:17.985
He used to own
his own advertising company.

19:18.065 --> 19:19.105
I worked under him.

19:20.545 --> 19:22.745
Why did you two quit then?

19:24.265 --> 19:25.465
We lost the drive.

19:26.065 --> 19:27.465
In all those years,

19:27.545 --> 19:29.985
we encountered many unreasonable clients.

19:30.745 --> 19:32.665
Every day, our work could not be finished.

19:33.265 --> 19:34.945
People couldn't be reasoned with.

19:35.025 --> 19:36.145
They blew hot and cold.

19:36.225 --> 19:40.225
And we spent every day carrying out
useless communication.

19:41.145 --> 19:43.025
I quit. I was tired.

19:44.905 --> 19:47.425
Why didn't he continue then?

19:48.025 --> 19:50.545
Do not ever mention
his company before him.

19:50.625 --> 19:51.705
He'll scowl at you.

19:53.145 --> 19:55.385
We were betrayed by one of our own.

19:56.305 --> 19:57.545
Luke was seriously affected by it.

19:58.665 --> 20:01.225
Besides, his family prohibited him
from starting his own business.

20:01.825 --> 20:02.865
What were you guys talking about?

20:04.985 --> 20:06.305
How's your hand?

20:06.385 --> 20:07.345
I'm fine.

20:07.425 --> 20:09.265
The doctor said not to wet the wound.

20:09.345 --> 20:10.185
Be mindful of that.

20:12.185 --> 20:13.505
I'll leave you two be then.

20:13.585 --> 20:14.545
I'll bring the car over.

20:20.585 --> 20:21.825
Come. We'll drive you home.

20:22.345 --> 20:23.745
I already hailed a taxi.

20:24.345 --> 20:25.505
You two are leaving now?

20:25.585 --> 20:26.465
Are you not going to look after her?

20:27.665 --> 20:29.105
Why should I?

20:29.825 --> 20:31.345
I already informed her family.

20:34.945 --> 20:37.185
You must think
I'm an irresponsible playboy.

20:38.425 --> 20:39.665
No.

20:39.745 --> 20:42.905
Relationships can be messy
and complicated.

20:43.905 --> 20:44.825
Worry not.

20:44.905 --> 20:46.945
I won't tell anyone. I swear.

20:48.665 --> 20:50.385
I do not believe in vows.

20:51.105 --> 20:53.025
And I don't care about others' opinions.

20:53.105 --> 20:54.145
She and I already broke up.

20:55.225 --> 20:56.905
When two people first get together,

20:56.985 --> 20:58.585
I think they often share the same goal.

20:58.665 --> 21:00.625
But as time goes by,
people might change their minds.

21:00.705 --> 21:03.985
It's no one's fault
if the relationship falls apart.

21:04.065 --> 21:05.025
People want different things, that's all.

21:05.105 --> 21:07.785
She chose to hold onto it,
and you chose to let go.

21:07.865 --> 21:08.745
There's no right or wrong.

21:09.345 --> 21:10.985
So you're saying
I should keep entangling with her,

21:11.065 --> 21:12.625
even though I no longer love her.

21:13.505 --> 21:15.265
No, I didn't say that.

21:16.145 --> 21:20.505
I just think that love shouldn't
make one this miserable.

21:22.905 --> 21:24.145
How many relationships have you had?

21:25.905 --> 21:28.025
Just one.

21:28.625 --> 21:29.625
How was the breakup?

21:30.865 --> 21:32.865
A reluctant separation
with mutual blessings?

21:33.665 --> 21:36.665
We had good intentions
when we got together,

21:36.745 --> 21:39.745
and we didn't break up unhappily.

21:42.385 --> 21:44.505
You're quite mature when it comes to love.

21:50.105 --> 21:52.225
I… I think my taxi is here.

21:52.305 --> 21:53.345
Let me check.

22:24.905 --> 22:26.105
Tao.

22:26.185 --> 22:27.345
How come you're back?

22:27.905 --> 22:30.025
Want to hang out tonight?

22:30.105 --> 22:31.185
I can't.

22:31.265 --> 22:33.185
I need to brush up on my English.

22:33.265 --> 22:34.505
My colleagues all studied abroad.

22:34.585 --> 22:35.825
I don't want to fall too far behind.

22:35.905 --> 22:39.345
-You go ahead.
-You stay at home all the time.

22:39.425 --> 22:41.505
You've been studying every day
during your days off.

22:41.585 --> 22:43.745
You're affecting my after-work life.

22:44.265 --> 22:45.105
All of you are here.

22:46.145 --> 22:47.545
You should go out and relax.

22:47.625 --> 22:48.465
It's Friday today.

22:49.225 --> 22:51.225
I'm dumb, so I have to work harder.

22:52.985 --> 22:55.145
Oh. My friends invited me to play the game
<i>Legends of the Three Kingdoms</i> later.

22:55.225 --> 22:56.185
Do you want to join us?

22:57.305 --> 22:58.585
What did I just say?

22:58.665 --> 23:00.265
Friday is meant for fun.

23:00.345 --> 23:02.105
LTK or the bar.

23:02.185 --> 23:03.265
Pick one.

23:03.345 --> 23:04.585
Neither.

23:09.185 --> 23:10.185
Talk some sense into her.

23:12.385 --> 23:15.745
Oh. I fixed this one. Take this.

23:20.625 --> 23:22.705
-Thank you.
-You're welcome.

23:27.345 --> 23:29.025
Stop hesitating, Tao.

23:29.105 --> 23:31.585
Sun's friends must be very smart.

23:31.665 --> 23:33.505
Let's go meet some quality people.

23:33.585 --> 23:35.025
It's just studying
in a different place, right?

23:35.625 --> 23:36.825
So that's a deal then. I'll get changed.

23:36.905 --> 23:37.905
Hurry up.

23:37.985 --> 23:39.065
I changed my mind. I'll wear this.

23:39.145 --> 23:40.145
It's pretty.

23:53.225 --> 23:55.345
-Let me check on my cards.
-That's rough, buddy.

23:55.425 --> 23:56.985
Wait, how does "Kill" work?

23:57.065 --> 23:58.185
-Can I just use "Dodge" to get out of it?
-Hello!

23:58.265 --> 24:00.185
-It's rare that Sun is willing to come out
-Hello.

24:00.265 --> 24:01.465
and he brought
two beautiful girls with him.

24:02.665 --> 24:03.785
Introduce them to us.

24:04.465 --> 24:07.385
I am Sun Yu.
You can call me Yu or Dabaoyu.

24:07.985 --> 24:08.985
Hello.

24:09.065 --> 24:10.025
This is Tao.

24:10.105 --> 24:11.225
-Shang Zhitao.
-Hello.

24:11.305 --> 24:12.985
-Take a seat.
-Come.

24:13.065 --> 24:14.945
-The drinks are here.
-Careful.

24:16.705 --> 24:19.065
-Thanks.
-Hello.

24:19.145 --> 24:21.225
My name is Long Zhentian.

24:22.265 --> 24:23.585
Your Chinese is so good.

24:23.665 --> 24:25.065
I am Feng Qiuhuang.

24:26.585 --> 24:28.465
-Shang Zhitao.
-Hi.

24:28.545 --> 24:31.305
Zhentian is my batchmate
from the university. He's Canadian.

24:31.385 --> 24:33.345
His native languages
are English and French,

24:33.425 --> 24:34.905
and he speaks really good Chinese.

24:35.745 --> 24:36.945
I can tell.

24:37.025 --> 24:39.225
You like playing LTK as a foreigner?

24:39.305 --> 24:41.545
So-so. The third best player in the world.

24:45.465 --> 24:49.945
I'm actually looking for a Chinese tutor
to practice my speaking skills.

24:50.025 --> 24:51.265
You're looking for a Chinese tutor?

24:51.985 --> 24:55.185
What a coincidence.
Tao is looking for an English tutor.

24:55.265 --> 24:58.265
You two can exchange numbers
and study with one another.

24:58.345 --> 25:00.825
Wonderful. Give me a call.

25:01.425 --> 25:02.265
Type your number.

25:03.385 --> 25:06.025
What's your goal
for your English proficiency?

25:06.745 --> 25:09.585
As good as your Chinese proficiency.

25:10.385 --> 25:12.305
Then, you'll have to work hard.

25:12.385 --> 25:14.305
You too.

25:14.385 --> 25:15.905
All right. Enough serious talk.

25:15.985 --> 25:17.425
-Deal the cards now.
-Deal the cards.

25:17.505 --> 25:19.185
Here. Take this.

25:33.265 --> 25:34.105
Come in.

25:35.345 --> 25:37.745
Boss. I'm leaving now.

25:43.345 --> 25:45.145
It's Friday today.

25:45.225 --> 25:46.985
You don't live to work.

25:48.545 --> 25:49.745
It's only 7 p.m.

25:49.825 --> 25:51.305
But it's the weekend now.

25:51.385 --> 25:53.785
A normal person would already
be queuing at a hot pot restaurant.

25:53.865 --> 25:55.105
Just go.

25:55.665 --> 25:56.505
Happy weekend.

25:57.305 --> 25:58.305
Do go home early.

26:14.625 --> 26:17.905
It seems Yuanzhu has been charmed.

26:18.545 --> 26:19.785
-Allow me.
-Mince your words now.

26:19.865 --> 26:21.705
-Thanks.
-If Sun gets mad,

26:21.785 --> 26:23.225
he'll kill your character off.

26:23.305 --> 26:25.785
Sun has a good temper. He won't kill you.

26:25.865 --> 26:27.545
You don't know this.

26:27.625 --> 26:29.625
Back then, our boss stole his code

26:30.505 --> 26:32.185
and even tried to pin
the blame on him and fire him.

26:32.265 --> 26:33.905
And he just flipped the table.

26:33.985 --> 26:35.665
I didn't know
you could be this aggressive.

26:36.345 --> 26:37.585
You're always so even-tempered.

26:37.665 --> 26:40.145
That guy must have been very awful
to make you this angry.

26:40.225 --> 26:43.225
Guess what happened next?

26:43.305 --> 26:47.105
That jerk couldn't understand
the logic behind Zhu's code.

26:47.185 --> 26:49.785
There was a bug, and he couldn't fix it.

26:49.865 --> 26:53.425
So he came crawling back
and begged Zhu to come back.

26:53.505 --> 26:55.665
You should've seen the face of that loser.

26:55.745 --> 27:00.785
Well, Zhu, what did you tell him?

27:03.185 --> 27:06.865
I told him that at work,
nothing was a given.

27:06.945 --> 27:08.425
No one should think that
they are above everyone else.

27:09.385 --> 27:12.065
Without the effort of the employees,

27:12.145 --> 27:13.705
no matter how big the company is,

27:13.785 --> 27:15.865
it's just an empty shell.

27:15.945 --> 27:17.185
Don't lie.

27:17.265 --> 27:19.825
What you wanted to say was…

27:23.705 --> 27:25.025
Screw you!

27:30.385 --> 27:31.225
Come. Carry on.

27:31.305 --> 27:32.145
-Come.
-It's your turn now.

27:32.225 --> 27:33.785
I use Invasion of Nanman.

27:40.465 --> 27:42.505
-I don't have any strike cards.
-Strike cards.

27:42.585 --> 27:43.625
I don't have any strike cards.

27:43.705 --> 27:44.905
I still have one, Tao.

27:46.465 --> 27:48.105
<i>Sun Yu. They are having an event here.</i>

27:48.185 --> 27:49.465
<i>Where are you?</i>

27:49.545 --> 27:51.225
<i>Come now. Quick.</i>

27:51.945 --> 27:54.625
Okay. Sure. I'll be there.

27:55.145 --> 27:56.025
Okay.

27:58.705 --> 27:59.545
Sorry, guys.

27:59.625 --> 28:03.105
My boss told me
something happened at the event.

28:03.185 --> 28:05.065
I need to head back to fix it.

28:05.145 --> 28:07.265
I have to go now.
I'm so sorry. I'm so sorry.

28:07.345 --> 28:09.305
My company can't live without me.

28:09.385 --> 28:10.825
I have to go now.

28:10.905 --> 28:12.305
-Bye.
-Take care.

28:12.385 --> 28:14.345
It's hard to get a ride here.
I'll drive you out.

28:15.265 --> 28:16.305
-Okay.
-Let's go.

28:16.385 --> 28:17.265
Come.

28:17.825 --> 28:19.305
It's getting late.
Let's head back as well.

28:19.385 --> 28:20.585
-Okay.
-Okay.

28:20.665 --> 28:21.665
We'll hang out another time.

28:21.745 --> 28:23.145
-See you.
-Bye.

28:23.225 --> 28:24.745
-Bye.
-We'll go as well.

28:24.825 --> 28:26.265
-Bye.
-Bye.

28:29.985 --> 28:32.665
Are you free later?

28:32.745 --> 28:33.665
Do you have time?

28:33.745 --> 28:36.105
Maybe we can have our first session today?

28:37.145 --> 28:38.265
Really?

28:38.345 --> 28:39.225
Yes.

28:39.825 --> 28:41.425
Should we go somewhere else?

28:42.105 --> 28:43.425
-Sure.
-Okay.

28:43.945 --> 28:44.905
Let me pack this up.

28:52.305 --> 28:53.025
‎Hello.

28:53.105 --> 28:54.305
<i>Where are you?</i>

28:54.385 --> 28:55.465
About to drive home.

28:55.545 --> 28:57.305
<i>Song Qiuhan and Chen Kuannian are back.</i>

28:57.385 --> 28:58.625
<i>Let's grab a drink today.</i>

28:58.705 --> 29:00.105
-<i>Their bar is launching today.</i>
-No, thanks.

29:00.785 --> 29:02.505
<i>Dude. It's the weekend.</i>

29:02.585 --> 29:05.265
<i>Are you really going to stay at home</i>
<i>and talk to your fish?</i>

29:05.945 --> 29:07.585
That's my time with my pet.

29:08.345 --> 29:09.225
<i>Fine.</i>

29:09.305 --> 29:12.385
<i>If I cannot convince you,</i>
<i>the others will call you anyway.</i>

29:12.465 --> 29:13.905
<i>Find a way to turn them down then.</i>

29:13.985 --> 29:15.025
<i>Hanging up.</i>

29:33.545 --> 29:34.665
This is the place.

29:34.745 --> 29:35.825
It's new.

29:35.905 --> 29:39.185
I heard there's
a special performance tonight.

29:39.265 --> 29:40.785
It's crowded.

29:41.785 --> 29:44.185
Drifters in Beijing all gather here.

29:44.265 --> 29:45.865
It's the culture.

29:45.945 --> 29:46.985
The culture.

29:58.065 --> 30:00.625
This is the soul of Beijing.

30:00.705 --> 30:01.905
You work during the day.

30:01.985 --> 30:04.265
You live at night.

30:04.345 --> 30:05.585
It is quite different.

30:05.665 --> 30:07.545
When I first came to Beijing,

30:07.625 --> 30:09.705
I could not speak a word of Chinese.

30:09.785 --> 30:12.945
I learned it all from friends
I made in bars.

30:13.025 --> 30:14.625
It's the same with English.

30:14.705 --> 30:16.225
You can't rely on textbooks alone.

30:16.305 --> 30:17.785
You must come here

30:17.865 --> 30:21.185
and be immersed
in a real language environment.

30:22.425 --> 30:23.745
Let me teach you how to order a drink.

30:30.105 --> 30:31.025
Qiuhan.

30:31.105 --> 30:32.745
How much did you invest in this place?

30:34.785 --> 30:36.305
-How much?
-Chen Kuannian invested in it as well.

30:36.385 --> 30:37.625
-We're in it together.
-What do you think?

30:38.705 --> 30:39.585
I invested in it too.

30:40.865 --> 30:42.545
You two sure are rich.

30:42.625 --> 30:44.225
It is good.

30:44.305 --> 30:45.305
This place is not bad, right?

30:45.385 --> 30:47.025
-But your decor is…
-Decor is…

30:47.105 --> 30:48.705
The location is good.

31:05.185 --> 31:06.985
Is that you, Mr. Luan?

31:07.065 --> 31:08.305
Your fish finally let you out?

31:09.225 --> 31:10.425
Luan Nian?

31:11.505 --> 31:12.385
Let him out?

31:12.465 --> 31:14.265
I bet his fish is sick of him,

31:14.345 --> 31:15.905
so it kicked him out.

31:16.945 --> 31:19.265
Since you're here,
then we must have a drink.

31:19.345 --> 31:20.465
It's on you.

31:20.545 --> 31:21.585
Consider it your gift for my opening day.

31:21.665 --> 31:23.585
Don't. I just paid it.

31:23.665 --> 31:25.105
As you should.

31:25.185 --> 31:26.305
-Come.
-Come.

31:29.585 --> 31:30.585
Hello.

31:43.785 --> 31:45.265
You need to work on your pronunciation.

31:54.385 --> 31:55.145
Yes.

32:05.025 --> 32:06.745
You said two martinis ten times.

32:06.825 --> 32:07.745
That's 20 martinis.

32:18.305 --> 32:20.905
Long Zhentian. We'll split the bill.

32:22.505 --> 32:23.665
Okay.

32:23.745 --> 32:25.985
Then, I'll teach you more things today.

32:26.065 --> 32:26.905
What do you want to learn?

32:28.065 --> 32:31.865
I want to learn how to politely
turn down drinks during a business dinner.

32:32.865 --> 32:33.785
But…

32:33.865 --> 32:35.505
You're Chinese,

32:35.585 --> 32:36.465
and you work in advertising.

32:36.545 --> 32:38.625
How are you supposed
to close deals without drinking?

32:39.905 --> 32:40.865
Even you say so.

32:40.945 --> 32:44.105
So, how do I learn to hold my drinks?

32:44.185 --> 32:45.465
Just drink more.

32:45.545 --> 32:46.865
-Really?
-Yes.

32:55.065 --> 32:58.385
Maybe recite some Chinese poems or idioms.

32:58.465 --> 32:59.665
It'll be even better.

32:59.745 --> 33:01.945
Quick. Teach me something.

33:04.145 --> 33:05.825
What makes you drunk
is not liquor, but desires.

33:06.585 --> 33:08.985
What makes you drunk
is not liquor, but desires.

33:09.065 --> 33:12.345
But sorrows feel even more bitter
when you drown them with liquor.

33:12.425 --> 33:16.625
But sorrows feel even more bitter
when you drown them with liquor.

33:16.705 --> 33:18.425
Yes. Cheers.

33:18.505 --> 33:19.465
Cheers.

33:26.585 --> 33:29.745
Luke. We haven't heard you sing in years.

33:29.825 --> 33:31.105
It's our opening day today.

33:31.185 --> 33:32.585
Sing for us.

33:32.665 --> 33:33.745
No way.

33:33.825 --> 33:35.625
Don't say no.

33:35.705 --> 33:37.105
Everyone is here.

33:37.185 --> 33:38.025
It's our bar.

33:38.105 --> 33:39.265
You won't embarrass yourself.

33:40.705 --> 33:41.625
No.

33:41.705 --> 33:43.905
You're still the same
as when you were at school.

33:43.985 --> 33:44.825
You don't play along.

33:44.905 --> 33:50.185
Just get off your pedestal
and let us enjoy your talent.

34:06.905 --> 34:07.865
Will I get paid?

34:08.545 --> 34:09.744
-I…
-Yes.

34:10.385 --> 34:11.824
When we were studying…

34:11.905 --> 34:13.065
-How much was it again?
-500 yuan.

34:13.145 --> 34:13.985
-Yes, 500 yuan.
-Yes, 500 yuan.

34:14.065 --> 34:15.665
I'll pay you ten times that amount. No.

34:15.744 --> 34:20.304
If you can sing until morning,
I'll give this bar to you.

34:21.545 --> 34:23.065
You might as well earn it.

34:29.465 --> 34:31.304
-Seriously?
-Here he goes.

34:31.385 --> 34:32.304
He's doing it.

34:32.824 --> 34:33.905
Gosh!

34:36.824 --> 34:38.065
Yes!

34:50.985 --> 34:54.425
Do you think Luan Nian
is quite distracted today?

34:54.505 --> 34:55.784
What is he looking at?

34:55.865 --> 34:57.225
Impossible.

34:57.305 --> 35:00.225
Who is this beauty who earns his gaze?

35:02.145 --> 35:03.785
I think I know that girl.

35:03.865 --> 35:05.385
-Which one?
-Which one?

35:06.265 --> 35:07.585
Did he find a new girlfriend?

35:07.665 --> 35:08.745
No way.

35:08.825 --> 35:10.105
Why didn't he tell us?

35:15.945 --> 35:18.265
Anyway, I have to use the toilet.

37:22.265 --> 37:23.185
Luan Nian!

37:32.785 --> 37:33.625
<i>Luan Nian?</i>

37:38.025 --> 37:39.305
Are you okay?

37:47.865 --> 37:49.625
-Where did he go?
-Who?

37:50.185 --> 37:52.065
The singer.

37:52.145 --> 37:53.465
Luke.

37:54.745 --> 37:55.745
Sorry, but…

37:55.825 --> 37:58.225
No one was singing.

37:58.305 --> 37:59.865
Are you drunk?

37:59.945 --> 38:01.745
Can you continue?

38:03.785 --> 38:04.745
A toast to music.

38:04.825 --> 38:06.145
A toast to friends.

38:06.825 --> 38:07.785
A toast to good food.

38:07.865 --> 38:09.425
A toast to stupid people.

38:23.665 --> 38:26.345
I can't drink anymore.

38:26.425 --> 38:28.705
I want to go home.

38:31.385 --> 38:33.385
-Not bad, Luan Nian.
-You still have it.

38:33.465 --> 38:34.865
Pay up.

38:34.945 --> 38:36.545
Foot the bill now.

38:37.225 --> 38:39.465
I asked you to sing until morning,
not just one song.

38:39.545 --> 38:41.745
Thank you.

38:49.105 --> 38:50.185
Hey, hey.

38:50.265 --> 38:51.905
Hey, calm down. Calm down.

38:51.985 --> 38:52.945
What's happening?

38:55.425 --> 38:56.505
What are you doing?

38:56.585 --> 38:58.145
-Easy now.
-What's going on?

38:59.545 --> 39:01.225
-Girlfriend?
-Luke.

39:05.985 --> 39:07.025
It's you.

39:28.025 --> 39:29.305
Are you really her tutor?

39:29.385 --> 39:31.105
-Cheers.
-Yes.

39:31.185 --> 39:32.305
Private English tutor.

39:33.385 --> 39:33.945
Let's go.

39:34.025 --> 39:34.865
No.

39:39.185 --> 39:40.905
She hasn't finished her work.

39:42.385 --> 39:43.945
It's the weekend.

39:44.025 --> 39:45.385
What work?

39:49.825 --> 39:51.385
Are you done with the summary report?

39:51.465 --> 39:52.745
And here you are, at a bar.

39:52.825 --> 39:54.065
Summary report?

39:54.145 --> 39:55.225
Not done yet.

39:55.305 --> 39:56.705
Can you teach me?

39:56.785 --> 39:57.905
Sure.

39:58.665 --> 39:59.665
I'll drive you home.

40:02.225 --> 40:03.345
Wow.

40:03.985 --> 40:05.305
Easy now. Come.

40:05.385 --> 40:06.225
-They are working.
-I'll be going now.

40:06.305 --> 40:06.985
-Come. Let's drink.
-Let's drink.

40:07.065 --> 40:07.785
-Bye.
-Come. Let's drink.

40:07.865 --> 40:09.025
Let's drink.

40:19.025 --> 40:20.705
-Stand straight.
-Stand straight.

40:21.825 --> 40:23.025
I'll buy some water to sober you up.

40:23.105 --> 40:25.145
I'll buy some water to sober you up.

40:25.225 --> 40:26.265
Stand straight!

40:28.665 --> 40:30.105
You're doing this on purpose, aren't you?

40:31.265 --> 40:33.625
How can you be this handsome

40:34.145 --> 40:35.465
when you're angry?

40:36.785 --> 40:37.705
Stop it.

40:40.785 --> 40:41.625
What?

40:42.865 --> 40:44.785
They say you are very mean,

40:44.865 --> 40:46.505
but I don't think so.

40:47.665 --> 40:50.385
You just have a duck bill.

40:51.745 --> 40:53.745
A duck bill. You know what?

40:54.265 --> 40:56.705
A duck bill is like this.

40:58.705 --> 40:59.785
Useless Lumi.

41:00.305 --> 41:01.865
Look.

41:05.865 --> 41:06.905
Like this.

41:07.585 --> 41:09.385
You keep appearing in my dreams.

41:09.465 --> 41:10.665
Like this.

41:11.505 --> 41:12.585
What happened in the dream?

41:14.385 --> 41:15.865
I…

41:17.505 --> 41:18.705
I…

41:20.505 --> 41:22.185
I was scolding you.

41:23.585 --> 41:26.385
You wish. Shang Zhitao.

41:27.665 --> 41:30.625
It's time for you to lose weight
because you're about to break my arms.

41:30.705 --> 41:31.905
Luan Nian!

41:32.745 --> 41:35.385
My dad tells me to eat more.

41:35.465 --> 41:37.065
Otherwise, a strong gust of wind
will blow me away.

41:38.145 --> 41:39.305
Tell your father not to worry

41:39.385 --> 41:40.905
because you have aced that task.

41:49.625 --> 41:50.545
Is your dad good to you?

41:50.625 --> 41:51.665
Is your dad not good to you?

41:54.785 --> 41:56.465
Does he know you're stupid?

41:57.345 --> 41:58.265
You're drinking
when your ankle is barely healed.

42:00.665 --> 42:02.265
Do not underestimate me.

42:03.345 --> 42:05.065
I am slow,

42:05.585 --> 42:10.785
but every step I take is very real.

42:15.185 --> 42:16.505
See?

42:16.585 --> 42:18.625
-Did you see it?
-Yes.

42:19.265 --> 42:20.225
Let me show you.

42:26.065 --> 42:27.825
Yes, very real. Come.

42:33.665 --> 42:35.305
Mister. To Tiantong Dongyuan.

42:35.385 --> 42:36.465
To Tiantongyuan.

42:45.905 --> 42:50.305
SHANG ZHITAO

42:56.425 --> 42:59.225
SUN YU

43:05.505 --> 43:08.865
TIANTONG DONGYUAN, SECTION 1

43:15.345 --> 43:16.705
Over there.

43:30.865 --> 43:31.905
Sixty what?

43:34.025 --> 43:35.065
6…

43:35.825 --> 43:38.025
602.

43:38.705 --> 43:39.825
Sunflower.

43:39.905 --> 43:41.745
The one with a sunflower.

43:48.825 --> 43:49.945
Sit down.

43:59.145 --> 44:00.545
I am not drunk.

44:02.785 --> 44:04.785
Who is it?

44:06.265 --> 44:07.585
Who are you?

44:09.625 --> 44:10.985
Crazy.

44:12.465 --> 44:13.665
Sun Yu.

44:15.185 --> 44:16.265
Sun Yu!

44:16.345 --> 44:19.025
Stop it, or I'll call the police.

44:28.745 --> 44:29.865
Where is your home?

44:31.905 --> 44:33.785
I don't know.

44:35.065 --> 44:36.585
I want to sleep.

44:42.505 --> 44:44.065
Does it still hurt?

44:45.705 --> 44:46.545
No.

44:53.905 --> 44:56.185
I got this when I was saving you.

44:56.265 --> 44:58.905
Back in ancient times…

45:08.785 --> 45:10.145
You'd have to marry me.

45:31.225 --> 45:32.265
Come home with me.

46:04.065 --> 46:05.985
You're quite mature when it comes to love.

46:13.065 --> 46:16.505
You must think
I'm an irresponsible playboy.

46:19.185 --> 46:22.985
Isn't an amicable separation
what breaking up is all about?

46:54.665 --> 46:55.545
<i>I knew it.</i>

46:55.625 --> 46:59.745
<i>When you relax,</i>
<i>your brain will betray you.</i>

46:59.825 --> 47:03.145
<i>Instead of finding ways</i>
<i>to gain a footing at work,</i>

47:03.225 --> 47:05.385
<i>I think of useless things like this.</i>
